.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH quotadial-watch 1  "QuotaDial 0.2.0" QuotaDial
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
quotadial\-watch \- Keep showing usage, refreshing every minute. No provider is asked more often than its own limit, so most refreshes show cached numbers with their age
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquotadial watch\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Keep showing usage, refreshing every minute. No provider is asked more often than its own limit, so most refreshes show cached numbers with their age
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one line of JSON per refresh instead of text
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH "SEE ALSO"
quotadial(1). The full guide is docs/CLI.md in QuotaDial\*(Aqs repository, https://github.com/pghmatt/quotadial, and quotadial.com.
